  "description": "Should You Buy? Should You Short? Or Something Completely Different....",
  "body_html": "<p>This is just a general update for everyone. I realize the market is giving investors whiplash rapidly and that is why we are…doing nothing. Fact is, everyday is some unforeseen, not calm event. This creates a very difficult environment…for both bulls and bears! </p><p>Ill be doing some short term day trading…I suspect shorting…however due to the whiplash this can cause it will only be in the chat. Fully cognizant not everyone can do that (and thats ok!). Regardless, you are more than welcome to hop in and ask any questions you may have. </p><p>We are still here. Still monitoring for the day we can post “Load the Truck!” 🛻. But that is not now. DO NOT LEAVE….people that left missed most, if not all, of the prior bull market. I will keep you updated as the market evolves. </p><p>Thanks for stopping by 👍</p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
